  "bodyHash": "9af49e182e235bcd",
  "content": "\n\n```\n<hr>\n<h1>安装指南（非常重要）</h1>\n<p>（如果您使用的是早于 1.14 版本的 tacz，部分文件夹位于 .minecraft/config/tacz）</p>\n<ol>\n<li>安装最新版本的 <strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffiles.minecraftforge.net%252fnet%252fminecraftforge%252fforge%252findex_1.20.1.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forge</a></strong> 或 <strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fneoforged.net%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">NeoForge</a></strong>。</li>\n<li>安装 <strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcreate\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create</a></strong> 0.5.1.f 或更高版本。</li>\n<li>如果您使用 Forge，请安装 <strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/timeless-and-classics-zero\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Timeless and Classics Zero</a></strong>；如果您使用 NeoForge，请安装 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/tacz-1-21-1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>[非官方] TaCZ NeoForge 移植版</strong></a>。</li>\n<li>启动 Minecraft，让 Timeless and Classics Zero 创建其目录。</li>\n<li>安装 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/customization/tacz-create-armorer-koei\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Create Amorer</strong></a> 并将 .zip 文件放入 .minecraft/tacz。</li>\n<li>将本模组安装到模组文件夹中。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>可选步骤：移除枪工坊的 TaCZ 合成表（推荐）</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>将 minecraft/tacz/tacz-pre.toml 的 &nbsp;DefaultPackDebug 选项更改为 true</li>\n<li>进入 .minecraft/tacz 并打开您下载的 create armorer zip 文件（可使用 WinRAR）。删除 data/create_armorer/recipes 中的 recipes 文件夹</li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>额外步骤：删除所有原版工作台合成表</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>进入 .minecraft/tacz/tacz_default_gun/data/tacz 并删除 recipes 文件夹\n&nbsp;</li>\n</ol>\n<hr>\n<p><strong>寻找更多枪械包整合？</strong>来看看这个 Immersive Armorer 的附加模组！</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcreate-immersive-armorer-integration\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1152431/description_9ae2fdde-5b4b-4537-9c95-a5094c0f5fda.png\" alt=\"\"></a>\n&nbsp;</p>\n<h4><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/978675/description_0c80647f-43e3-48ee-bce9-f81d45f49717.png\" alt=\"\"></h4>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>本模组添加了 <strong>制作和自动化</strong> Create Amorer 中枪械、弹药和配件的方法，打造沉浸式 Create 体验。</p>\n<p>现在枪械的合成表更加真实，弹药也可以批量生产！</p>\n<p>只有 Create Armorer 武器适用于此模组，因为它们最适合 Create 玩法。</p>\n<h1><strong>新枪械部件！</strong></h1>\n<p>添加了新物品作为制作武器时的中间步骤。</p>\n<h2><strong>枪管</strong></h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1152431/description_1c9a1bff-85f6-4918-9dd1-3560ec76f255.png\" alt=\"image\"></p>\n<h2><strong>扳机组件</strong></h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1152431/description_103ef41c-451e-4cf0-ad75-f0c28994507b.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h2><strong>击发机构</strong></h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1152431/description_ff84806d-929a-43b5-9405-84dcb0881e25.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h1><strong>新枪械合成表！</strong></h1>\n<p>由于 TaCZ 武器相比普通的 Minecraft 和 Create 武器确实更加强大，因此已使用新的枪械部件来平衡合成表。现在您需要精密机械和机械合成器等组件才能制作它们。</p>\n<h2><strong>新\"扭矩\"左轮手枪合成表</strong></h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1152431/description_d9e08f66-0a87-4cfe-81de-0ff451cf3d78.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h2><strong>新\"应力\"自动手枪合成表</strong></h2>\n<h2><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1152431/description_9131c5d3-5e0a-4eff-bf3e-d089a10aa2fd.png\" alt=\"\"></h2>\n<h2><strong>新\"发条\"狙击步枪合成表</strong></h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1152431/description_83a42696-94d5-4991-a3bf-2bc52727dd26.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h2><strong>新\"经典 M1\"半自动步枪合成表</strong></h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1152431/description_48fa31fc-34ce-43f4-98f5-cd32bc008512.png\" alt=\"image\"></p>\n<h2><strong>新\"起重机\"突击步枪合成表</strong></h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1152431/description_0e078480-ad24-4706-998f-64acab261c06.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h2><strong>新\"滚轮\"突击步枪合成表</strong></h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1152431/description_77d2cf38-9524-44e2-a251-beddeb72a5c0.png\" alt=\"image\"></p>\n<h2><strong>新\"石\"霰弹枪合成表</strong></h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1152431/description_af175836-e08d-403c-b556-471bb7139303.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h2><strong>新\"轴承\"霰弹枪合成表</strong></h2>\n<h1><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1152431/description_73c15fe9-1676-415b-83a1-9a8ec64ad949.png\" alt=\"\"></h1>\n<h2><strong>新\"曲柄\"冲锋枪合成表</strong></h2>\n<h1><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1152431/description_27e18b1e-2993-4ed2-8c7a-4ed24b3e4225.png\" alt=\"\"></h1>\n<h2><strong>新\"毁灭者\"榴弹发射器合成表</strong></h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1152431/description_e8c857ce-1677-446c-a8ec-49bf29104ede.png\" alt=\"image\"></p>\n<h2><strong>新\"蝾螈\"肩射 40mm 野战炮合成表</strong></h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1152431/description_f7a1c904-acf1-42b9-ad59-0b2a286318b2.png\" alt=\"image\"></p>\n<h2><strong>新\"飞轮\"机枪合成表</strong></h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1152431/description_7492801b-094b-47fe-98e1-ea6e69243575.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h2><strong>新\"原子破坏者\"近战武器合成表</strong></h2>\n<p>（该武器在新版本中已移除）</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1152431/description_52ff91f8-5d03-4817-a200-50349df65e5f.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h2><strong>新\"扳手\"近战武器合成表</strong></h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1152431/description_83c10937-0f2c-47a6-a78c-3e8a8ef8b83f.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h1><strong>新枪械配件合成表！</strong></h1>\n<p>一把枪没有<strong>配件</strong>就不完整，因此添加了更多合成表来制作配件。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1152431/description_8f7c5f15-6668-43d2-9d2d-af53cc5b0c14.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1152431/description_05f62b62-2cbf-4a2f-9c06-ed5fcd8a3c43.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1152431/description_deaa98a9-bd11-4140-911f-2c723c8579c0.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1152431/description_ffba74f3-d1c3-4c52-9e6f-d679886b8bc1.png\" alt=\"image\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1152431/description_c4a41a2f-a87f-4e65-bf62-c4fe9c21092b.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1152431/description_9461e2d1-523b-4aa3-b466-c091d509b820.png\" alt=\"\"> &nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1152431/description_a5c6e183-61d7-484b-9b2f-06a085f49258.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1152431/description_518867cc-7d22-43f7-b162-417928b8a48a.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1152431/description_e98f9d80-ccf0-4719-8327-e5dfcdd53175.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1152431/description_c6e654b6-9a8b-45a4-bea6-8acd7d412305.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1152431/description_3aed786c-354a-4f30-ae06-e85cc30e9f44.png\" alt=\"\"> &nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1152431/description_2a34660d-25d7-43a5-9737-4709f7c9b1aa.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1152431/description_579af3cb-4934-4cb5-bb0a-e1be07933d28.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1152431/description_032ac40d-838f-41ab-ba46-dbf2a82321c3.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1152431/description_b9f7632e-237f-46ee-825f-067298ed5471.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1152431/description_3836dacd-6c1c-4c6c-9303-6ebede5a360a.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1152431/description_8b60fdca-76c0-4d80-b3bf-527a5b8743bd.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1152431/description_82a52bab-b6aa-4e51-b7ca-30c8a3987b5a.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1152431/description_11be11ce-fcd1-4c9b-b586-3c1149f23983.png\" alt=\"image\"></p>\n<h1><strong>新弹药底火！</strong></h1>\n<p><strong>弹药底火</strong>通过切割黄铜板制作。您可以使用 JEI 设置过滤器选择您需要的底火类型，让切割机将其切成相应的类型。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1152431/description_3b40259a-2da4-46f3-bbc5-54365fc5c349.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h1><strong>新流体！</strong></h1>\n<p><strong>火药</strong>现在可以以流体形式存储在储罐中，用于各种合成表。如果您安装了 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-big-cannons\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create Big Cannons</a>，您还可以存储<strong>硝化火药</strong>，它在制造底火时比火药更高效。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1152431/description_bf3d69cb-12f3-4976-a02d-aae6558ac1af.png\" alt=\"\"> &nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1152431/description_09c7285c-e7c8-45de-8bfe-8741c552580f.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h1><strong>新弹药合成表！</strong></h1>\n<p>制作弹药需要<strong>底火</strong>。底火通过向安山弹壳中注入火药或硝化火药制作。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1152431/description_9bfa81c9-a5df-42b6-8529-75e6c390987f.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1152431/description_e3120cf5-efc0-4422-ad7d-55e4d655a8f5.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>现在您已经拥有底火了，可以将它们插入弹壳并填充火药来制作您选择的弹药类型。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1152431/description_07bc5695-766a-47bd-8aa8-f7ca6465a4b2.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>通常情况下，Create 没有自动化黄铜的合成表，因此请记住在尝试建立新枪械工厂时准备好合适的开采设施。</p>\n<p>本模组主要为个人使用而制作，但如果您有任何建议，欢迎随时提出！</p>\n<hr>\n<h1>常见问题</h1>\n<p>问：启动游戏时出现错误。</p>\n<p>答：尝试将 Forge 更新到更新的版本。</p>\n<p>问：使用切割机时制作了错误的物品。</p>\n<p>答：这意味着有另一个模组具有相同的合成表。在切割机中使用过滤器，使其仅输出您需要的物品。</p>\n<hr>\n<p>本模组主要为个人使用而制作，但如果您有任何建议，欢迎随时提出！</p>\n<h2>看看我的其他模组！</h2>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcreate-totem-factory\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1264989/description_609b037b-78cb-4497-8b4f-c95c77def773.png\" alt=\"image\"></a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcreate-mechanical-companion\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1152431/description_3eebc495-7c50-4bec-9c5b-43b13ec09ac0.png\" alt=\"\"></a>  </p>\n<p>想报告错误、分享评论、建议功能并获取更新？加入我们的官方 Discord 频道！</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/jWqsA8EPeC\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/978675/description_4336ae1a-a280-4da5-8faa-7588ff631da4.png\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a></p>\n<p>如果您喜欢本模组并希望支持其开发，非常感谢您的捐赠 ❤️</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fmarcosjoestar\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/efd4f135b5a14adcfde1b1a22c4442888096f952.png\" alt=\"Ko-fi Logo\"></a></p>\n```",
